ALL AROUND WORK BOOT FOR WOMEN These women's western boots are designed for outdoor activities that may require a sturdy work boot such as working in a barn, gardening, and fixing fences; Their robust construction enables them to withstand outdoor conditions
ROBUST BUT COMFORTABLE These boots are built with quality materials and construction to make it long-lasting; additionally, boots were also built for comfort, with air-mesh lining for improved breathability and taped interior seams
WATER-RESISTANT AND EASY TO CLEAN Made to endure mud and other types of muck, these hard worker boots have a water-resistant full-grain oiled leather vamp; the insoles are moisture-wicking and can be removed to be washed in a washing machine to keep it clean;
PROVIDES MAXIMUM STABILITY The XSD one-piece insole has an injection composite X shank for superior support and stability; the full-length compression-molded EVA midsole also offers extra stability even on uneven terrain;
SLIP-RESISTANT AND DURABLE The outsole has an integrated spur ridge and is made with molded rubber infused with rice husk for durability;

